Dear Ms. Jade,

Well noted your concerning of B/Haul svc.
Kindly find our comment as below :

JKTBA
>> KPI EB : We don't have any objection if you sell D2 on KPI, but it seems=
 that you don't evacuate D2 on KPI a lot, but only D4 outbound has been inc=
reased. If so, we should apply GRI for D4 and D5, so kindly let us know if =
it is possible to push small quantum of GRI on this lane. If yes, please le=
t us know your ideal quantum and sectors.
JKTBAS =3D=3D=3D=3D>  as per BBG's instruction, we impose increment rates f=
or some destinations.   For KPI,  starting 20th November, we increase rates=
 $ 25~50/D5 for IDJKT/XGG. While from 1st Dec, JKTBAS increases  $ 25/50 fo=
r KRINC & KRKAN's cargo.  This is also apply for CKI & KIS's cargo to INC &=
 KAN.


>> KIS EB : Please let us know if it is ad hoc perform or chronic figure. K=
indly also let us know if it is possible to push small quantum of GRI on th=
is lane. If yes, please let us know your ideal quantum and sectors.
JKTBAS =3D=3D=3D=3D> Increase $ 25/50 for KRINC/KRKANs starting 1st Dec .


>> CKI EB : Due to VVD BSA drastic decrease, kindly let us know if it is po=
ssible to push small quantum of GRI on this lane
JKTBAS =3D=3D=3D=3D> Market rates to China are very competitive, especially=
 competitors that also have direct service , offering $ 40/80 , subject  to=
 doc & seal to CHSHA.
Although our BSA drastic decrease, there is no effect in market, since comp=
etitors have open space to China area.
But we will try to impose $25/D5 on top for CNSHA & CNNBO.

Overall, we will keep to push sell more D2 on KPI/CKI/KIS.

Thank you & regards,
Trijono/JKTBAS



