<div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">Oct. 23, 2013<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">TO : All offices under SINWA<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">CC : CCB, CCE<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">FM : WSG<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">Appreciate your efforts to in crease B/Haul performance.<o:p></o:p></span=
></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">As you know well,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">SINWA RHQ have emphasized continuously that our target for B/Haul perform=
nace is not the given&nbsp;QTA
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">but above 50% against BSA.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">Although we have achieved target against QTA as the below table,&nbsp;Per=
formance against BSA is barely 42%.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">Of course, we know that there are so many&nbsp;restriction to increase pe=
rformance such as new service launching,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">long holiday, political conditions, loading limitation caused by bottlenc=
ek etc.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">Nevertheless,&nbsp;we&nbsp;need to do our utmost to achieve our&nbsp;inte=
rnal target for the remainder of this year.
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">(above 50% against BSA)&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">T4, all offices are strongly requested to intensify B/Haul sales activiti=
es for the rest of this year.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;=
">RHQ will monitor B/Haul performance by office and support offices' reques=
t as&nbsp;much as possible.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
